    "sentence_translations": [
      "Should I Tip?",
      "",
      "Amy: Hello, waiter. This is my check and money. The extra is your tip.",
      "",
      "Waiter: Thank you! But in China, you don’t need to tip us.",
      "",
      "Amy: Really? But I want to thank you. In the United States, we tip when we eat at restaurants.",
      "",
      "Waiter: I know people tip in many places. But in China, you don’t need to tip us.",
      "If you think we did a good job, just say “thank you” to us and we’ll be very happy.",
      "",
      "Amy: Okay, thank you!",
      "",
      "Waiter: You’re welcome! Here is your change. Please hold on to it! Take care!"
    ]
  }
